[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602878637","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101829#issuecomment-2602878637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101829","id":2602878637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bJMat","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T16:46:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T16:46:37Z","body":"The `System.MissingMethodException` exception usually happens when Godot breaks compatibility. In this case, the method `Godot.FileAccess.StoreBuffer` was changed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78289 (4.4-dev6).\n\nThis means that your project or one of its dependencies were built against an older/newer version of the Godot bindings (the `GodotSharp` package). Make sure your C# project and all its dependencies are built against the same version of the Godot bindings, and that this version matches the version of the Godot editor you are using (presumably 4.4 beta 1).\n\nYou didn't provide a [minimal reproduction project](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4c1f11944ebfe1204f21c6ac488c7a2294e1d520/CONTRIBUTING.md#provide-a-simple-example-project), only a code snippet that references undefined variables. This is not enough because, as explained above, the issue is not with the code you are using.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602878637/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603550078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101829#issuecomment-2603550078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101829","id":2603550078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bLwV-","user":{"login":"bestvcboy","id":42270303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjcwMzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42270303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy","html_url":"https://github.com/bestvcboy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bestvcboy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T03:22:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T03:22:23Z","body":"Thank you, it was my version that got it wrong. sorry","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.gi